nged code; `:occN` separates repeats. Full ID: `<path>#<ID>`.\n- `doctor_mcp_client.py` — `D:<module>`; retain the two actionable client-wiring failure classes.\n- `doctor.py` — `D:<module>`; retain diagnostic-versus-repair boundary and non-destructive guarantees.\n- `fsck_authorship.py` — `D:{<module>,EnvAuthorshipTally.identity_pairs}`; retain per-environment tally purpose and identity-divergence data.\n- `fsck_repair.py` — `D:{<module>,is_snapshot_orphan,snapshot_missing_sources,missing_sources_finding,rebuild_source_state,repair_or_plan}; C:<module>:before:{_AUTO_RECOVER_ORPHAN_TYPES,item:KEY_ADD,_PUSH_TIMEOUT}; C:_repair_ticket:before:import:_commands.fsck_restore; C:repair_or_plan:before:triage`; retain orphan classification, incomplete-log refusal, dry-run, and human-triage boundaries.\n- `fsck_restore.py` — `D:{_deleted_history,_deleted_path_for_uuid,restore_deleted_sources,rebuild_with_restore}`; retain newest-deletion selection, per-path fallback, retired-file restoration, and incomplete-log refusal.\n- `fsck_scan.py` — `D:{<module>,_check_json_validity,_check_create_events,_advisory_lines,_active_event_map}; C:_check_create_events:before:return:lines-issues-signed_total-unsigned_tot; C:_check_index_lock:before:_reclaim_if_stale_index_lock; C:_scan:before:env_findings; C:_check_snapshot:before:{if:_is_stale_channel_snapshot,if:_is_snapshot_orphan}`; retain check ownership, counted/report-only distinctions, and snapshot/orphan rules.\n- `fsck_tracker_health.py` — `D:{<module>,_tracker_health,foreign_store_path_list,_foreign_store_paths,dirty_tracker_classes}`; retain tracker-level checks, shared pollution classifier, and dirty-tree classes.\n- `fsck.py` — `D:{<module>,_fsck_govern}; C:<module>:before:_NEVER_COUNTED_TRACKER_DIRTY_KINDS; C:_missing_tracker_result:before:diagnostic; C:fsck_cli:before:{repair_snapshots,_rc,lines+issue_count,compat_error}`; retain command ownership, counted-versus-report-only semantics, and parser governance.\n- `gates.py` — `D:{<module>,GateState,gate_enabled,_disposition_close_exempt,close_plan_review_gate_check,_plan_review_gate_applies,description_cap_warning,log_advisory_warning,log_description_cap_warning,plan_review_precheck}; C:<module>:before:{_PLAN_REVIEW_EXEMPT_TYPES,_LINK_BACKED_DISPOSITION_CLASSES}; C:close_plan_review_gate_check:before:{return::occ1,return::occ2,store}; C:plan_review_precheck:before:{ticket_type,ssh_hint}`; retain current gate states, exemptions, local-only validation, and fail-closed behavior.\n- `identity.py` — `D:{<module>,create_identity_core,is_placeholder,ensure_identity_for,add_identity_key,revoke_identity_key,use_identity,resolve_current_identity,identity_cli}`; retain entity fields, resolve-or-mint idempotence, key lifecycle, and current-identity precedence.\n- `init.py` — `D:{<module>,_untrack_runtime_markers_unit,_main_worktree_tracker,pending_init_is_symlink,pending_init_attaches_to_existing}; C:<module>:before:{import:_commands._init_ensures,_git_fetch}; C:init_core:before:{_run_ensures_logged:occ1,_run_ensures_logged:occ2}; C:_gen_local_files:before:mint_env_id_guarded`; retain bootstrap outputs, cold-fetch rationale, ensure order, and consent predicates.\n- `lifecycle_cascade.py` — `D:{<module>,cascade_parent_first}; C:cascade_parent_first:before:if:resolve_parent`; retain ancestor lifecycle invariant, cycle guard, and benign-race condition.\n- `metrics.py` — `D:<module>`; retain command responsibility and fault-isolation behavior.\n- `recent_creates.py` — `D:{<module>,duplicate_create_warning}`; retain normalized-title/window logic, journal ordering, and advisory gating.\n- `session_id.py` — `D:<module>`; retain resolution precedence and the explicit never-HEAD rule.\n- `session_log.py` — `D:{<module>,_resolve_session_fp}`; retain rotation/pointer semantics and shared session resolver.\n- `tracker_maintenance.py` — `D:<module>`; retain supported-door safety envelope, backup, audit, and human-only force policy.\n- `transition_close.py` — `D:{<module>,_pin_completion_ref,sign_completion_verdict,record_completion_verdict,_apply_caused_by,_sign_completion_and_report,_trigger_compaction,_hint_disposition_alternative,_plan_review_close_recheck}; C:_apply_caused_by:before:provenance; C:_sign_completion_and_report:before:{_manifest,if:HEAD}; C:close_ticket:before:{completion_signature:ab128a6,ref,atomic_delivery,if:closed:a6008f6:occ1,completion_signature:a66a8dd,if:closed:ab250c9}`; retain ref pinning, sign/record ordering, best-effort blame, nonblocking compaction trigger, and close-gate exclusions.\n\n## Protected material / consumers\nExcluded as concise/policy-load-bearing (19 blocks): `fsck_repair.py#D:_dry_run_plan; C:<module>:before:_git`; `fsck_restore.py#D:_uuid_fallback`; `fsck_scan.py#D:_check_index_lock; C:_check_create_events:before:if:status_fork_resolutions; C:_scan:before:tracker_lines+tracker_issues`; `fsck.py#C:fsck_cli:before:if:do_repair`; `gates.py#D:{GateState.__bool__,_claim_gate_reason}; C:plan_review_precheck:before:try`; `init.py#C:<module>:before:{_git,_commit_precommit}; C:init_core:before:{if:.git,if:rev-parse+--is-inside-work-tree,host_git,lock_dir,_ensure_branch_user_config}`; `transition_close.py#C:close_ticket:before:{completion_expectation,if:closed:a6008f6:occ2}`. Preserve the other 231 prose blocks, all inline comments/runtime strings/regexes/prompts/assertions/data, and executable AST. Keep 25 directive and 0 shebang lines exact with inline/next-code attachment. No allowlisted docstring has a runtime documentation reader. CLI, store-health, identity, initialization, lifecycle, and close-gate suites consume the named behavior rather than literal prose.\n\n## Independent receipt\nRequire exactly 106 non-author, leaf-linked TSV rows:\n`stable_id<TAB>full_before_SHA:path#ID<TAB>full_final_SHA:path#ID<TAB>contract_or_consumer<TAB>before_words<TAB>after_words<TAB>directives_exact<TAB>semantic_preservation<TAB>bloat_removal<TAB>reviewer_session`.\nEach needs `after_words < before_words` and PASS in all three verdict columns. Missing/duplicate/extra/author-reviewed/short-SHA/non-PASS rows block closure.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] The receipt has exactly 106 unique `stable_id` rows.\n- [ ] Every receipt row has full before/final SHA-and-block citations.\n- [ ] Every receipt row satisfies `before_words > after_words`.\n- [ ] Every receipt row records `directives_exact=PASS`.\n- [ ] Every receipt row records `semantic_preservation=PASS`.\n- [ ] Every receipt row records `bloat_removal=PASS`.\n- [ ] Every `reviewer_session` identifies a non-author reviewer.\n- [ ] DD `immutable-prose-only` exits 0.\n- [ ] DD `exact-leaf-paths` exits 0.\n- [ ] DD `focused-tests` exits 0.\n- [ ] DD `scoped-ruff` exits 0.\n- [ ] DD `comment-hygiene` exits 0.\n- [ ] DD `diff-integrity` exits 0.\n- [ ] DD `repository-gates` exits 0 without a timeout.\n\n## Verification\nRun seven persisted DD rows: immutable-prose-only, exact-leaf-paths, focused-tests, scoped-ruff, comment-hygiene, diff-integrity, repository-gates.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/doctor_mcp_client.py","reason":"Condense 1 frozen prose block (312 base words); retain the two actionable client-wiring failure classes."},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/doctor.py","reason":"Condense 1 frozen prose block (396 base words); retain diagnostic-versus-repair boundary and non-destructive guarantees."},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/fsck_authorship.py","reason":"Condense 2 frozen prose blocks (358 base words); retain per-environment tally purpose and identity-divergence data."},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/fsck_repair.py","reason":"Condense 11 frozen prose blocks (803 base words); retain orphan classification, incomplete-log refusal, dry-run, and human-triage boundaries."},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/fsck_restore.py","reason":"Condense 4 frozen prose blocks (365 base words); retain newest-deletion selection, per-path fallback, retired-file restoration, a